1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,757
Three ways to make phenol.

2
00:00:01,757 --> 00:00:13,580
From chlorobenzene, by the Dow process: sodium hydroxide at three hundred degrees and a hundred and fifty atmospheres, since chlorobenzene is so unreactive.

3
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:23,789
From benzene diazonium chloride, simply by warming its acidic solution above five degrees, so nitrogen bubbles off: the mild laboratory method.

4
00:00:23,789 --> 00:00:30,299
And from benzene sulphonic acid, by fusing its sodium salt with solid sodium hydroxide.

